# Workflow plan step W8 (docs/WORKFLOW_PLAN.md, 2026-11-14): starters that teach. Each "Good places to start" card says what
# it teaches; the case made from it keeps that and the answer to expect (.qc-starter), shown on Overview until "Got it",
# and on Results as "Compare with".
click nav:new case
wait 10
assert text You'll learn how a moving wall drives a flow
screenshot $OUT/w8_cards.png
click starter#0
wait 5
click clone-go
wait-until page Overview timeout 15
wait 10
assert file $SB/ws/cavity/.qc-starter
assert log $SB/ws/cavity/.qc-starter Ghia
assert text Lid-driven cavity: what it teaches
screenshot $OUT/w8_overview.png
click nav:results
wait 20
assert text Compare with
screenshot $OUT/w8_results.png
click nav:overview
wait 10
click ov-starter-seen
wait 10
assert file $SB/ws/cavity/.qc-starter-seen
assert not text Lid-driven cavity: what it teaches
